WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.407
<v NARRATOR>You're standing in the kitchen of the chapter house during new-member week, and your little is being made to drink shot after shot while reciting chapter history, and she's shaking, and now she's throwing up — and someone's filming it for the group chat.

00:00:13.407 --> 00:00:14.832
<v NARRATOR>Your gut says tell someone.

00:00:14.832 --> 00:00:20.269
<v NARRATOR>Your gut also says if you do, your sisters will call you a snitch and freeze you out before initiation.

00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:22.855
<v NARRATOR>That second feeling is the one worth questioning.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:27.447
<v NARRATOR>Here's what's actually true: hazing causes real and lasting harm, and it can be deadly.

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:34.837
<v NARRATOR>Reporting it protects your little and the other new members — that's not betrayal, that's exactly what caring about your sisters looks like.

00:00:34.837 --> 00:00:41.382
<v NARRATOR>And whatever you decide about reporting, you can choose right now not to be part of it — don't pour, don't film, don't push.
